  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One turn of the loop",
      "items": [
        "1 · the agent calls log_session_concepts while it works",
        "2 · PostToolUse reads that row and returns additionalContext",
        "3 · which is an instruction to ask — never the question itself",
        "4 · the model plans, asks, then grades with record_attempt",
        "Budget is per session: mid-task answers are ones Stop no longer asks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Four hooks, four mechanisms",
      "items": [
        "SessionStart — stdout: profile + the directive that starts it all",
        "PostToolUse — exit 0 + JSON; skipped inside subagents",
        "Stop — exit 2 + stderr is what actually blocks the turn",
        "PreToolUse(Bash) — permissionDecision \"deny\" on git commit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Server, state and boundaries",
      "items": [
        "stdout is the protocol; diagnostics are forced to stderr",
        "retryOnBusy wraps every handler; openDb migrates and seeds",
        "Config precedence exists twice: config.ts in TS, lib.sh in jq",
        "Two commit gates — one on the session, one on the repo; both fail open",
        "Launcher prefers mcp/dist; npx @1.7.0 only without a local build"
      ]
    }
  ]
